# Where the enquiry form delivers.
#
# Leave this unset and the form posts to FormSubmit for leahtfl@gmail.com,
# which works after a one-time activation click in the first email.
#
# Two reasons to set it:
#   1. FormSubmit's hashed endpoint keeps the address out of the built bundle.
#      Find the hash in the FormSubmit dashboard once the address is activated.
#   2. Switching provider entirely (Formspree, Web3Forms, your own handler).
#
# The endpoint must accept a JSON POST and respond 2xx on success.
#
# VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formsubmit.co/ajax/your-hash-here
